{
  "description": "Documents that both tuning validators must judge the same way for records used through \"$ref\": the game's (VeyraTuning.cpp, test Veyra.Core.Tuning.ConformanceCorpus) and CI's (scripts/check_tuning.py, tests/test_tuning.py). Each document is raw text checked against TuningConformanceRefs.schema.json at schemaVersion 1.",
  "cases": [
